## THE SCRIPT, read before it was run and never written
org/missions/D5/AMGT/AMGT_HARVST/deliverables/2.0.0_SA_COO_W1/round84/bz5_cycle_read.py, 2138 bytes.
Read in full: it globs <state>/cycles/<publisher>/*.cycle.json, keeps records with
started_at >= --since that have an ended_at, takes the FIRST that holds a failure (else the NEWEST),
counts a failure as NAMED when `detail` is present, differs from `status`, and contains ':'. It
opens nothing for writing and makes no network call.

